  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With an integer array `arr`, output `true` if there are three consecutive odd numbers in the array. Otherwise, output `false`.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: arr = [2,6,4,1]\nOutput: false\nExplanation: There are no three consecutive odds.\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: arr = [1,2,34,3,4,5,7,23,12]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: [5,7,23] are three consecutive odds.\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= arr.length <= 1000`\n* `1 <= arr[i] <= 1000`",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
